                                "sense_id": "5307ff72-8497-3093-ba98-36dab4b854a0",
                                "text": "In the course of (2014 repair) works it was discovered that inappropriate cementitious repairs had been carried out historically on the top of the tower inside the parapet wall at the base of the steeple."
